OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man dies in suspected
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian died following a suspected
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash in Hull.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said it was reported
OL,11,Fa silver car was exiting Colonial
OL,12,FStreet and turned left on to Park
OL,13,FStreet before colliding with a
OL,14,F67-year-old man at about 17:30 GMT on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FOfficers said the pedestrian, a
OL,18,F67-year-old man, was taken to hospital
OL,19,Ffor treatment but died on Sunday
OL,20,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
