OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man dies in suspected
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the driver, a 21-year-old
OL,7,Fman, reportedly failed to stop at the
OL,8,Fscene. He was located and arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving and failing to stop.
